---
description: Calle design-system rules for UI work in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Read TUTORIAL.md then DESIGN.md before writing or changing UI.

Hard rules: Inter (medium body, semibold headings), 8px rounding (`rounded-lg`), tight card padding, greyscale surfaces, one accent (`ember` | `sun` | `ice`) via CSS variables. Minimal copy — no emojis, no eyebrows, no helper badges. Icons are Lucide, `size-4`, muted unless active. Wrap product pages in AppShell. Reuse components/ui and components/kit.
